          <a href="https://www.scu.edu.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sichuan University</a><span class="sn-ref" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sidenote">B.Eng., School of Cyber Science and Engineering, Chengdu, 2021–2026.</span>.
